<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>PALETTE</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">PALETTE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2Hs9NAaMYwyeE1uJBm72lf</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.966" end="00:13.357">Keeping me awake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.357" end="00:15.522">I'm thinking of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.522" end="00:18.393">How there's so much at stake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.393" end="00:21.237">I hope that you're like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.237" end="00:23.911">I hope that it's only me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.911" end="00:26.925">You're talking to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.925" end="00:29.289">I sit here and I worry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.289" end="00:33.110">Till I'm over my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.110" end="00:35.427">Cause I'm scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.427" end="00:38.833">Don't want to be left alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.833" end="00:45.410">But with you, I can forget and try again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.410" end="00:46.933">Spare me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.933" end="00:50.071">I don't know what love is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.071" end="00:52.238">Can you tell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.238" end="00:56.213">I'm moving so cautiously</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.213" end="00:57.713">But you're why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.373" end="00:58.873">I feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.799" end="01:00.299">And how you make</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.085" end="01:01.749">It seems alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.749" end="01:04.636">I see color for the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.636" end="01:12.636">In my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.935" end="01:31.369">Don't want to make it seem like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.369" end="01:35.251">It's all infatuation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.251" end="01:40.240">But how you're always making me feel so blue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.240" end="01:45.920">I want to do it right, do all of what you like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.920" end="01:52.198">To get you all the flowers that will never ever die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.198" end="01:54.652">Cause I'm scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.652" end="01:57.857">Don't want to be left alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.857" end="02:04.587">But with you, I can forget and try again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.587" end="02:06.087">Spare me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.022" end="02:09.194">I don't know what love is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.194" end="02:11.232">Can you tell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.232" end="02:15.195">I'm moving so cautiously</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.195" end="02:16.695">But you're why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.294" end="02:17.794">I feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.792" end="02:19.292">And how you make</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.125" end="02:20.739">It seems alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.739" end="02:23.542">I see color for the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.542" end="02:31.542">In my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.769" end="02:51.269" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Spare me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.190" end="02:56.343" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I don't know what love is)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.343" end="03:00.343" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'm moving so cautiously)</p></div></body></tt>